sequenceDiagram
    participant Authority as Authority User
    participant GateEE as eFTI Gate (eu-xx01)
    participant GateFI as Remote Gate (eu-yy01)
    participant Platform as Platform (plt-xxx-001)

    Note over Authority: Consignment found in<br/>search (seq-03).<br/>UIL: gateId / platformId<br/>/ datasetId.

    Authority->>+GateEE: GET /v1/dataset/eu-yy01/plt-xxx-001/a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890?subsetId=EU07
    Note over Authority,GateEE: Authorization: Bearer JWT<br/>(is_admin)<br/>X-Request-ID echoed.

    GateEE->>GateEE: Validate JWT (signature, exp, iss, aud, not in denylist),<br/>require is_admin — subsetCheck
    GateEE->>GateEE: uil.gateId = "eu-yy01" ≠ Config.gateId "eu-xx01"<br/>→ Forward to remote gate

    GateEE->>GateEE: gateRegistry["eu-yy01"] → Gate{status=ONLINE}
    GateEE->>GateEE: checkGateAvailable(gate) → OK

    GateEE->>+GateFI: eDelivery AS4: UILQueryRequest<br/>(platformId=plt-xxx-001, datasetId=a1b2c3d4-..., subsetId=EU07, requestId=req-d4e5f6a7)

    GateFI->>GateFI: Parse UIL query
    GateFI->>GateFI: platformRegistry["plt-xxx-001"] → Platform{baseUrl="https://..."}
    GateFI->>+Platform: GET /v1/datasets/a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890?subsetId=EU07
    Note over GateFI,Platform: HTTP request with<br/>platform credentials.

    Platform->>Platform: Retrieve dataset XML for subset EU07
    Platform-->>-GateFI: 200 OK — consignment XML (default xmlns http://efti.eu/v1/consignment/identifier)

    GateFI-->>-GateEE: UILQueryResponse status=200 with consignment XML body

    GateEE-->>-Authority: 200 OK (application/xml) — X-Request-ID req-d4e5f6a7 — consignment XML body

    Note over Authority: EU07 subset received.<br/>Transport details,<br/>route, operator info.
